      "id": "061a770a-707c-4eaf-8c8e-a8896918ded0",
      "text": "On 2026-11-07, the owner chose a clickable interface with sample data as the first demo and included BrainMap alongside Capture, People/person details, Projects, and Birthdays. Exact screens, interactions, review criteria, production graph behavior, relationship extraction, and implementation remain unresolved. | When: 2026-11-07 | Involving: owner | This defines the first-demo scope without authorizing live AI, imports, connections, storage, or implementation.",
