    {
      "id": "d9e34b14-2593-4d82-958b-96a5dbd4c918",
      "text": "For the Astryx MemoryOS design prototype (relatedPageId: kp-45d072e221ad45948dfe1735704153d8), the owner rejected the restrained prototype and released the prior visual rules. The selected direction is a complete, adventurous redesign of the whole app using an expressive editorial system, bold color, distinctive screen compositions, visible navigation, and purposeful motion. | When: Friday, November 13, 2026 | Involving: Project owner | This replaces the previous home-reference aesthetic and hidden-only navigation.",
