    {
      "id": "8ee57ffa-aba9-44f8-a62d-2316e89c73a6",
      "text": "For project-memoryos, the four-layer architecture separating original sources, extracted information, owner-confirmed facts/corrections, and AI interpretations is not owner-approved or selected; current Markdown labels it as an assistant proposal. Preserve its source traceability and uncertainty as proposed design guidance, but do not promote A07/P02 into a selected architecture or owner approval. | When: November 7, 2026 | Involving: Project owner; assistant | A correction established that current owner instructions and current Markdown are authoritative, while A07 and P02 remain unapproved proposals.",
      "type": "world",
