    {
      "id": "d708db6e-9635-4d4e-98ba-8ab33521bfbb",
      "text": "Later on 2026-11-13, the owner rejected the restrained Astryx result, released the prior visual constraints for this design task, and authorized a complete wild redesign with new compositions, color, typography, illustrations, navigation, and motion. The redesign remained a design prototype requiring owner review and did not authorize service connections or native release. | When: 2026-11-13 | Involving: Project owner | This superseded the prior visual constraints for the design task while preserving the prototype-only scope.",
