      "text": "On 2026-11-12, the owner rejected the initial screen-layout proposal and requested deep online design-reference research, distinct design variants using design skills, and one localhost app with annotations for recording likes and dislikes. The reference-led lab at docs/design/reference-lab.md is the current exploration and has no approved variant or authorized native delivery. | When: 2026-11-12 | Involving: owner | C14 replaces the rejected first proposal with a reference-led design-review tool; the source document records exploration, not publication or implementation completion.",
